DTSTAMP:20261018T135423Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261017
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261019
SUMMARY:Oktoberfest at Schifferstadt
DESCRIPTION:Rain or shine! Free entry. Join us for our most popular event\, an important fundraiser for the operation of our organization and upkeep of Schifferstadt. Come enjoy great food and drink\, lively German music\, historic demonstrators\, tours of the museum\, and hand-made products from many arts & crafts vendors. Our biggest event of the year!
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/oktoberfest-at-schifferstadt/11763/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
