DTSTAMP:20261018T135423Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261018
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261019
SUMMARY:Abstract Acrylics Opening Reception
DESCRIPTION:Join us for our official opening reception of Abstract Acrylics: a taproom art show by Dena Martin\, on view October through the end of December. While the art will be on our walls starting October 1st\, join us on the 18th for a chance to meet Dena herself and to view her wonderfully dynamic and vibrant abstract art. All art will be available for purchase during the three-month show.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/abstract-acrylics-opening-reception/26211/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventcalvaryumcscommunityconcertseriesseanbrennanclassicalguitaristandnatanyashevavocalist25770-20261018@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20261018T135423Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261018
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261019
SUMMARY:Calvary UMC's Community Concert Series Sean Brennan\, classical guitarist\, and Natanya Sheva\, vocalist
DESCRIPTION:Calvary United Methodist Church (calvaryumc.org/concerts) located in historic downtown Frederick presents Sean Brennan\, classical guitarist and Natanya Sheva Washer\, vocalist. Experience an afternoon of rich and varied repertoire bringing together music that reflects a wide range of cultural voices and traditions with some nostalgic classics. The duo specializes in creating new arrangements of music that aren’t typically performed on guitar\, with a special focus on works by women and composers of color. This concert is sponsored in part by The Frederick Arts Council\, The Delaplaine Foundation\, and the William E. Cross Foundation. https://www.natanyawasher.com/ https://peabody.jhu.edu/preparatory/faculty/sean-brennan/
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/calvary-umcs-community-concert-series-sean-brennan-classical-guitarist-and-natanya-sheva-vocalist/25770/
END:VEVENT
