SUMMARY:Frederick Fall Festival
DESCRIPTION:Get ready for a fun-filled fall day at Carroll Creek Park this Sunday! Bring your family and friends to celebrate the season\, support local small businesses\, and enjoy a day full of community fun! What to Expect: Live Music & Entertainment Handmade Goods\, Local Small Businesses\, Art & more Delicious Food\, Thai\, Vietnamese Cuisine\, Sweet Treats & More! FREE Kids’ Activities\, including Twisted Balloons & Mini Pumpkin Painting Halloween Costumes Encouraged! Trick-or-Treating Fun for the Kids! Come shop\, eat\, play\, and have a wonderful time with your family and friends!
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/frederick-fall-festival/24264/
