UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventjumbospumpkinpatchfallfestival11483-20261018@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20261018T135423Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261018
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261019
SUMMARY:Jumbo's Pumpkin Patch Fall Festival
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the season with a full day of festive fun for all ages at Jumbo’s Pumpkin Patch! From classic farm adventures to fall-themed attractions\, our Fall Fun Festival is the perfect weekend outing for families\, friends\, and pumpkin lovers. What’s Included with Admission: Your ticket includes unlimited access to a variety of seasonal attractions: Hayrides through the farm 30+ acre u-pick pumpkin patch (pumpkins sold by the pound) Corn maze (14 acres) Petting zoo Jumping pillow Giant slides Mini mazes for younger guests Playgrounds and yard games General Store with fall shopping and décor​ Optional Add-Ons: (Available for Purchase Onsite - Saturday and Sunday Only) Enhance your day with these fun extras: Pony Rides – $7 Face Painting – $4 Sandy Candy (Edible Sand Art) – $4 Corn Cannon – $5 (3 shots) ​ Food & Drinks: Come hungry! A variety of food\, snacks\, and beverages are available for purchase\, including selections from Liquidity Ale Works of Mt. Airy. Tickets available online or at the gate.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/jumbos-pumpkin-patch-fall-festival/11483/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventkidcreatorfallmarket26174-20261018@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20261018T135423Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261018
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261019
SUMMARY:Kid Creator Fall Market
DESCRIPTION:Every Sunday in October\, pop into Dancing Bear Toys and Games to experience our Fall Market from 12 pm-4 pm! We are very excited to create this opportunity for kid creators to sell their creations and give the community a chance to support young entrepreneurs + business owners! Each Sunday you’ll find one kid creator selling their creations during time slots. See the schedule below! Fall Market Schedule: Sunday\, October 4: 12 pm-2 pm: Berklee (kandi creations and buttons) 2 pm-4 pm: Beads by the Bay (phone charms\, bracelets\, and fidgets) Sunday\, October 11: 12 pm-2 pm: Winston’s Wacky Fidget Factory (3D printed fidgets) 2 pm-4 pm: Nora’s Creations (kandi/pony beaded keychains and bracelets\, caterpillar chapstick holders\, buttons and pins) Sunday\, October 18: 12 pm-2 pm: Kalm Kidz (sensory bins) 2 pm-4 pm: Knotty Swag (paracord accessories including bracelets\, key chains\, water bottle holders and car hooks) Sunday\, October 25: 12 pm-2 pm: Avery (jars of slimes)
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/kid-creator-fall-market/26174/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventkninerescueadoptionevent26pawoween25849-20261018@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20261018T135423Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261018
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261019
SUMMARY:Knine Rescue Adoption Event & Paw-O-Ween
DESCRIPTION:Dogs? Beer? What better way to spend your Sunday afternoon! Knine Rescue is a non-profit 501(3)c organization dedicated to animal care and protection through helping shelters find forever homes for their rescues. Learn more here. Meet the pups in our taproom - Knine Rescue will be bringing adorable puppies and lovable adult dogs\, ready to be your new best friend! Get pre-approved for adoption here. We’re also celebrating Paw-O-Ween with mini photo shoots! Paws-In Studio will have a mini studio set up in our lounge for puppy photos. Your $50 reservation includes a 10-minute session and 3 professional digital images. Some costumes will be available\, but feel free to bring your pup’s favorite from home! AND 50% of Paws-In Studio’s proceeds will be donated back to Knine Rescue. Secure your reservation here.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/knine-rescue-adoption-event-%26-paw-o-ween/25849/
END:VEVENT
