SUMMARY:Life of a Honey Bee: Beekeeping Workshop at Loew Vineyards
DESCRIPTION:Join Loew Vineyards for our first Beekeeping and Honey Workshop at the Winery led by local Beekeeper\, John Gardner! John is the owner of Peaceful Beekeeping\, located in Frederick. This workshop includes: A program to learn all about bees and honey A honey tasting Mead tasting
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/life-of-a-honey-bee%3a-beekeeping-workshop-at-loew-vineyards/26181/
