BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventgirlsnightout3acheerstomidlife26247-20261020@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20261018T135423Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261020
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261021
SUMMARY:Girls Night Out: Cheers to Midlife!
DESCRIPTION:Cheers to Midlife! is an evening created for women navigating the changes\, challenges\, and opportunities that come with midlife. Join us at RAK Brewing Co. for an engaging panel of local female experts sharing their knowledge and experience in nutrition\, fitness\, aesthetics\, hormones\, and overall wellness. Each speaker will offer practical insight into her area of expertise\, with conversations focused on helping women better understand their bodies\, feel their best\, and approach this stage of life with confidence. The evening will also include an open Q&A\, giving guests the opportunity to ask questions\, connect with the experts\, and learn alongside other women experiencing many of the same changes. Come grab a drink\, join the conversation\, and raise a glass to midlife!
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/girls-night-out%3a-cheers-to-midlife!/26247/
END:VEVENT
