UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventeastfrederickrisingbustour26happyhour26222-20261021@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20261018T135423Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261021
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261022
SUMMARY:East Frederick Rising Bus Tour & Happy Hour
DESCRIPTION:Meet up in the taproom at 4:30 PM before embarking on an informative\, scenic bus tour showcasing new developments and project highlights across East Frederick. Afterward\, head back to Sandbox to connect with community members\, learn more about East Frederick Rising’s local impact\, enjoy our brews\, and grab some dinner from Old Line BBQ. Your ticket includes light snacks before the bus tour\, as well as two drink tickets that may be redeemed at our bar or aboard the bus. Proceeds benefit East Frederick Rising and its mission to advocate for smart growth in the East Frederick district\; protecting the character and charm of our community while modernizing infrastructure to support the city as a whole. Learn more about East Frederick Rising here. This event is 21+
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/east-frederick-rising-bus-tour-%26-happy-hour/26222/
END:VEVENT
