BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventkidcreatorfallmarket26174-20261025@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20261018T135423Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261025
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261026
SUMMARY:Kid Creator Fall Market
DESCRIPTION:Every Sunday in October\, pop into Dancing Bear Toys and Games to experience our Fall Market from 12 pm-4 pm! We are very excited to create this opportunity for kid creators to sell their creations and give the community a chance to support young entrepreneurs + business owners! Each Sunday you’ll find one kid creator selling their creations during time slots. See the schedule below! Fall Market Schedule: Sunday\, October 4: 12 pm-2 pm: Berklee (kandi creations and buttons) 2 pm-4 pm: Beads by the Bay (phone charms\, bracelets\, and fidgets) Sunday\, October 11: 12 pm-2 pm: Winston’s Wacky Fidget Factory (3D printed fidgets) 2 pm-4 pm: Nora’s Creations (kandi/pony beaded keychains and bracelets\, caterpillar chapstick holders\, buttons and pins) Sunday\, October 18: 12 pm-2 pm: Kalm Kidz (sensory bins) 2 pm-4 pm: Knotty Swag (paracord accessories including bracelets\, key chains\, water bottle holders and car hooks) Sunday\, October 25: 12 pm-2 pm: Avery (jars of slimes)
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/kid-creator-fall-market/26174/
END:VEVENT
